  "text": "Stop staring at a blank screen trying to figure out what to post today. Writers waste their best creative energy rewriting identical talking points for LinkedIn, Twitter, and email newsletters. Without an automated repurposing pipeline, your best ideas get published once and immediately disappear forever. Instead, drop your core essay into Notion and trigger Make to extract bite-sized daily snippets. You maintain daily consistency without creative exhaustion.",
